    "description": {
      "value": "A maestro's chair is a traveler's chair with the impulse control upgrade (see below) and a small pipe organ installed into the frame. You can use the maestro's chair to make Performance checks in the same manner that you could use any mundane instrument, using both of your hands. When you make a Performance check using your chair, you gain a +1 item bonus to the check.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per minute\n\nYou use your chair to Stride up to your chair's speed. If you have a composition cantrip that is currently active, you Sustain it as a free action."
